Śambūka declares śūdra birth and bodily heaven aim --- Rāma severs Śambūka head with bright sword --- Dead boy revives that very moment --- Rāma visits Agastya hermitage and bows happily --- Agastya welcomes guest and praises śūdra-slayer --- Agastya bids Rāma stay night and ride home --- Agastya offers shining Viśvakarman ornament --- Rāma accepts gift and asks its history